    <language>en</language>
    <type>imaginary world dataset</type>
    <title>Toril GIS (2026-07-30_2): Editable Offline Map of the Forgotten Realms</title>
    <abstract>Toril GIS is a QGIS-based geospatial database and mapping project for the Forgotten Realms. It digitizes geographic information from published maps and lore into structured GIS datasets that can be explored, analyzed, and used to create maps, 3D visualizations, and other geospatial products. The project supports multilingual map labels and is developed using free and open-source software. Visit https://www.geospatial-grimoire.com/worlds/toril/gis/ for more information.

USAGE TERMS: Toril GIS is unofficial fan content permitted under the Wizards of the Coast Fan Content Policy. It is not approved or endorsed by Wizards of the Coast. Portions of the materials used are the property of Wizards of the Coast. © Wizards of the Coast LLC.</abstract>
